config BR2_PACKAGE_INTERFACE99
	bool "interface99"
	select BR2_PACKAGE_METALANG99
	help
	  Interfaces (a.k.a. virtual functions, dynamic/ad-hoc
	  polymorphism, type classes, or trait objects) for C99/C11.

	  Header/macro-only build dependency, vendored here purely so
	  its extracted source tree can be handed to a dependent
	  package's CMake FetchContent as an offline override -- it
	  installs nothing to the target itself.

	  https://github.com/Hirrolot/interface99
